Hi,

try this,

med.fac = ddply(diamonds, .(cut, color), function(.d)
data.frame(x=median(.d$carat)))

ggplot(diamonds,aes(x=carat)) +
geom_histogram() +
facet_grid(cut~color)+ geom_vline(data=med.fac, aes(xintercept=x))

HTH,

baptiste

